license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x
abstract: >-
  The holographic memory as infrastructure: recall is the
  matrix-vector multiply Y = WX executed as one pass over a
  fixed-size structure (per-query cost independent of library
  size), and the hologram is an error-correcting code with
  measured physical-to-logical error-rate curves. Answers the
  memory wall and the logical-reliability race with one
  structure. Stdlib-only Python, classical throughout.
keywords:
  - in-memory-computing
  - holographic-memory
  - error-correction
  - memory-wall
  - wave-computing
